idence_for_text_component"": ""not_assessed"", ""evidence_for_text_bio_bridge"": ""not_assessed"", ""evidence_for_generative_model"": ""generates candidate hypotheses through grounded LLM reasoning"", ""boundary_case"": ""wrapper_boundary"", ""decision_rationale"": ""ELISA combines existing scGPT, BioBERT, and LLM components into an interactive agent, acting as a wrapper around pre‑trained models rather than presenting a novel generative architecture.""}",application_wrapper,yes,yes,application_wrapper,none,not_assessed,not_assessed,generates candidate hypotheses through grounded LLM reasoning,wrapper_boundary,"ELISA combines existing scGPT, BioBERT, and LLM components into an interactive agent, acting as a wrapper around pre‑trained models rather than presenting a novel generative architecture.",PASS,EXCLUDE,True,"{""paper_type"": ""application_wrapper"", ""bio_modality_present"": ""yes"", ""text_component_present"": ""yes"", ""text_bio_bridge_present"": ""no"", ""generative_model_present"": ""yes"", ""foundation_model_evidence"": ""yes"", ""primary_exclusion_code"": ""application_wrapper"", ""uncertainty_reason"": ""none"", ""evidence_for_text_component"": ""LLM-mediated interpretation"", ""evidence_for_text_bio_bridge"": ""none"", ""evidence_for_generative_model"": ""generates candidate hypotheses through grounded LLM reasoning"", ""boundary_case"": ""wrapper_boundary"", ""decision_rationale"": ""The abstract describes a framework that combines existing scGPT embeddings and BioBERT with an LLM for hypothesis generation, indicating wrapper‑style integration of pre‑trained models rather than a novel multimodal generative model; thus it is classified as an application wrapper and the text‑bio bridge is not central.""}",application_wrapper,yes,yes,no,yes,yes,application_wrapper,none,LLM-mediated interpretation,none,generates candidate hypotheses through grounded LLM reasoning,wrapper_boundary,"The abstract describes a framework that combines existing scGPT embeddings and BioBERT with an LLM for hypothesis generation, indicating wrapper‑style integration of pre‑trained models rather than a novel multimodal generative model; thus it is classified as an application wrapper and the text‑bio bridge is not central.",PASS|EXCLUDE,application_wrapper,yes,yes,no,yes,yes,application_wrapper,,LLM-mediated interpretation,none,generates candidate hypotheses through grounded LLM reasoning,wrapper_boundary,"The abstract describes a framework that combines existing scGPT embeddings and BioBERT with an LLM for hypothesis generation, indicating wrapper‑style integration of pre‑trained models rather than a novel multimodal generative model; thus it is classified as an application wrapper and the text‑bio bridge is not central.",EXCLUDE,application_wrapper,,EXCLUDE,application_wrapper,,False
