s were retained without modification.", "original_chars": 580, "evidence_quote": "ELISA was validated on six publicly available scRNA-seq datasets from CZ CELLxGENE Discover (Table 5)", "evidence_section_heading": "2.1 Datasets", "contains_evidence_quote": true, "contains_chunk_excerpt": true, "chunk_id": 10, "pages": [4], "doc_item_refs": ["#/texts/35"], "docling_graph_node_id": "DataSourceEvidence_d1568ca541d53803", "docling_graph_provenance": {"document_id": "4c33c0dfaf5366a3827667834163f047", "match": "verbatim", "chunks": [10], "pages": [4], "refs": ["#/texts/35"], "spans": [{"chunk": 10, "start": 60, "end": 128}]}, "grounding_source": "docling_graph_provenance", "match_type": "verbatim", "source_markdown": "data/docling_include_no_vlm_2026-07-09/markdown/full_2026_07_06_rec_003466.md", "derivation_source": "docling_markdown_heading_boundary_from_docling_graph_heading_path"}, {"section_type": "input_representation", "heading": "2.2 System architecture", "heading_path": ["2 Materials and Methods", "2.2 System architecture"], "heading_path_text": "2 Materials and Methods > 2.2 System architecture", "heading_level": 3, "line_start": 73, "line_end": 76, "text": "ELISA integrates four modules a hybrid retrieval engine, an analytical suite, a visualization toolkit, and an LLM chat interface operating on a shared serialized PyTorch embedding file per dataset. Each embedding file stores cluster identifiers, BioBERT semantic embeddings (768-d), optional scGPT expression embeddings, per-cluster differential expression statistics, gene ontology (GO) and Reactome enrichment terms, and metadata. This cluster-level representation eliminates the need for access to the original count matrix at query time.", "original_chars": 541, "evidence_quote": "Each embedding file stores cluster identifiers, BioBERT semantic embeddings (768-d), optional scGPT expression embeddings, per-cluster differential expression statistics, gene ontology (GO) and Reactome enrichment terms, and metadat